==Korean==

===Etymology===
From {{ko-l|이|this}} + {{ko-l|것|thing}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Ko-이것.ogg|Audio|lang=ko}}
{{ko-IPA}}

===Pronoun===
{{ko-pos|pronoun}} {{qualifier|demonstrative}}

# [[this]]
#* {{ko-usex|이것들은 무엇입니까? 프랑스 잡지입니다.|What are these? - They are French magazines. }}
#* {{ko-usex|어느 것이 그의 집인가요? 이것인가요, 저것인가요?|Which is his house, this one or that one? }}
====Usage notes====
{{ko-l|이것}} can contract to {{ko-l|이거}}. Thus, {{ko-l|이것[[은]]}} can contract to {{ko-l|이건}}, {{ko-l|이것[[이]]}} to {{ko-l|이게}}, {{ko-l|이것[[을]]}} to {{ko-l|이걸}}, and {{ko-l|이것[[으로]]}} to {{ko-l|이걸로}}.

